<title>FINLAND: METSALIITTO'S FINNFOREST TO INVEST IN SAWN GOODS.</title>
<headline>METSALIITTO'S FINNFOREST TO INVEST IN SAWN GOODS.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnforest, a unit of Metsaliitto-Yhtyma, said on Tuesday it would invest 150 million markka to raise sawn goods capacity at its Kertopuu mill in Lohja.</p>
<p>&quot;The amount of the building and machinery investments is about 150 million markka,&quot; Finnforest Oy said in a statement.</p>
<p>The investment would raise the mill's sawn goods annual output to 100,000 cubic metres from 60,000 cubic metres, it said.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +3589 6805 0247, e-mail news@reuters.fi</p>
